	systemFamilyHelp = "Usage: ocx system <status|settings|startup|diagnostics|sync|codex-app-server|codex-restart|update|codex-cli-update> ...\n\nManage headless runtime settings, startup, sync, diagnostics, OpenCodex updates, and read-only Codex CLI inspection.\n\nsystem update manages OpenCodex itself.\nocx system codex-cli-update check [--json]\nThe Codex CLI inspection command makes no package-registry request, does not execute Codex or npm, install or repair software, control a process, or write configuration or cache state.\n"
